# The daydream (decision 050): hold Home's shortcut and the island floats
# until it's let go. Default tokens: daydreamHold 450 ms, liftHold 400 ms.
# The app runs the shortcut's command (Home opens) and then reports it held.

scenario: holding Home's shortcut opens Home, then gives up and daydreams
panel p
home                                -> Expanded expanded=home
shortcut-down
wait 449                            -> Expanded daydream=no
wait 1                              -> Idle daydream=yes      # Home closed again: it floats instead
shortcut-up                         -> Idle daydream=no

scenario: a quick press only opens Home
panel p
home
shortcut-down
shortcut-up
wait 1000                           -> Expanded daydream=no

scenario: an activity keeps its pill while it daydreams, and an alert still shows
start a
shortcut-down
wait 450                            -> Compact daydream=yes
alert ping                          -> Alert daydream=yes
shortcut-up                         -> Alert daydream=no

scenario: in the air, clicks and Home do nothing
start a
panel p
shortcut-down
wait 450                            -> Compact daydream=yes
click                               -> Compact
home                                -> Compact
hold
wait 400                            -> lifted=no
shortcut-up
click                               -> Expanded                # landed: clicks work again

scenario: hiding ends the daydream, and a hold while hidden does nothing
start a
shortcut-down
wait 450                            -> daydream=yes
hide                                -> Hidden daydream=no
shortcut-up
shortcut-down
wait 1000                           -> Hidden daydream=no
show
wait 1000                           -> Compact daydream=no

scenario: a lift in progress lands when the daydream starts
screen 1000
start a
hold
wait 400                            -> lifted=yes
shortcut-down
wait 450                            -> daydream=yes lifted=no

scenario: holding again after landing daydreams again
start a
shortcut-down
wait 450                            -> daydream=yes
shortcut-up                         -> daydream=no
shortcut-down
wait 449                            -> daydream=no
wait 1                              -> daydream=yes

scenario: a press whose release went unseen starts a fresh hold
start a
shortcut-down
wait 300                            -> daydream=no
shortcut-down
wait 300                            -> daydream=no
wait 150                            -> daydream=yes
